        "question": "**[{{trigger.repo}}#{{trigger.number}}]({{trigger.url}})** by {{trigger.author}} ({{trigger.kind}}), {{trigger.changedFiles}} files, +{{trigger.additions}} -{{trigger.deletions}}: {{trigger.title}}\n\nCI on its head: {{steps.ci_now.ci}} {{steps.ci_now.ciUrl}}\n\n{{steps.review.summary}}\n\nApprove & merge sets it to merge once CI passes. Request changes posts your note (or the review's feedback) on it as a review; it is reviewed again when its author pushes. Close closes it, with your note as a comment.",
        "ticket": "{{steps.ticket.ticketId}}"
